			"date": "2022-11-17T14:33:04.443Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mastodon.social/@jed\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>jed</span></a></span> I have made this!</p><p><a href=\"https://www.zachleat.com/twitter/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://www.</span><span class=\"\">zachleat.com/twitter/</span><span class=\"invisible\"></span></a></p><p>Deep link to instructions for a bare bones version of it here: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=X3SrZuH00GQ&amp;t=1092s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://www.</span><span class=\"ellipsis\">youtube.com/watch?v=X3SrZuH00G</span><span class=\"invisible\">Q&amp;t=1092s</span></a> </p><p>And a blog post 😅 <a href=\"https://www.zachleat.com/web/own-my-tweets/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://www.</span><span class=\"\">zachleat.com/web/own-my-tweets/</span><span class=\"invisible\"></span></a></p><p>I also pledged to open source it with the help of <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mamot.fr/@nhoizey\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>nhoizey</span></a></span> (and co) to  <a href=\"https://github.com/tweetback\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"\">github.com/tweetback</span><span class=\"invisible\"></span></a> (still pending, sorry Nicolas!)</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
