			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> back in 2005 i couldn't understand why people were giving away so much valuable content to ad-run platforms.  The key was the social interaction, I think, as well as the ease of it</p><p>I guess now is a good time to work on /look for good ActivityPub plugins to everything 🙂</p>",
