			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://mastodon.social/@LFLegal/109524362254583179",
			"author": {
				"name": "Lainey Feingold",
				"url": "https://mastodon.social/@LFLegal",
				"avatarUrl": "https://fediverse.zachleat.com/avatars/original/missing.png"
			},
			"date": "2022-12-16T16:45:40.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> make it better, make it yours, AND make it accessible so you don’t exclude visitors who are disabled. <a href=\"https://mastodon.social/tags/a11y\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>a11y</span></a>.</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "109524394980497383",
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://mastodon.social/@LFLegal/109524394892141033",
			"author": {
				"name": "Lainey Feingold",
				"url": "https://mastodon.social/@LFLegal",
				"avatarUrl": "https://fediverse.zachleat.com/avatars/original/missing.png"
			},
			"date": "2022-12-16T16:53:58.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> I love my domain name too — LFLegal because in 2008 a blind friend rejected my idea of LaineyFeingold dot com.  No one would know how to spell my first or last name he wisely said, plus your email address won’t fit on your business card (remember those?) in one line of Braille. The url became my Twitter handle and now my Mastodon name.  My brand. Motto? Accessibility matters and listen to disabled people!  <a href=\"https://mastodon.social/tags/a11y\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>a11y</span></a></p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
