				"avatarUrl": "https://fediverse.zachleat.com/avatars/original/missing.png"
			},
			"date": "2022-12-16T16:57:15.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> and I should have added— accessibility makes your site better for everyone.  Story of why I have short summaries on the top of my articles is here. Accessibility is essential for some, useful for all <a href=\"https://www.lflegal.com/2020/09/refresh-2020/#Summaries-at-the-top-of-every-article\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://www.</span><span class=\"ellipsis\">lflegal.com/2020/09/refresh-20</span><span class=\"invisible\">20/#Summaries-at-the-top-of-every-article</span></a></p>",
