			},
			"date": "2022-12-16T17:08:31.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> Having your own website is a good backup. A place you can call your own. I use mine to consolidate my presences elsewhere. If any of them go tits up, I can replace the feeds.</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
