			"date": "2022-12-16T17:46:28.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> there are ways to have ownership of your site without paying for a domain name - not everyone can afford one! Sites like Neocities.org offer free static hosting, and as long as you have the code stored somewhere, you can reupload it anywhere else.</p>",
